                                "sense_id": "8a62e2b5-d308-36d8-be1d-5638896bdfff",
                                "text": "'The wind got up east, and sent us a flisking rain.' Marianne Spry.—1888. S. B. G. To flisk is to sprinkle with fine spray; […]"
